. do gformat.do 

. * Golden reference: the %g corpus (Q3). Each row prints the input's exact bit
. * pattern via %21x alongside its rendering, so the rule is reconstructable
. * without guessing what value was fed in.
. set more off

. set linesize 240

. 
. program define g4
  1.     * `0' is the whole argument line; `args' would split "(10^3 - 1)" into tokens.
.     local v `0'
  2.     di %21x (`v') "|" %9.0g (`v') "|" %10.0g (`v') "|" %12.0g (`v') "|" %16.0g (`v') "|" %21.0g (`v') "|"
  3. end

. 
. di "BITS|w9|w10|w12|w16|w21|"
BITS|w9|w10|w12|w16|w21|

